        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>@Template[type:emanation|distance:25]{25 feet} @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.v61oEQaDdcRpaZ9X]{Aura}</p>\n<p>Any creature starting their turn in or entering the area take [[/r 3d6[fire]]] on a @Check[type:reflex|dc:26|basic:true].</p>\n<p>The Lord of Gears is immune to damage from Steam Aura.</p>\n<p>If a creature is in the Steam Aura from multiple sources at the same time, it still only needs to make a single save. The aura is no more potent from coming from multiple sources.</p>"
        },
