        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>On a successful disable, the Pillar is deactivated for two rounds. This is the same disable effect as The Lord of Gears' Shocking Siphon ability.</p>\n<p>All hardness is removed until reactivation, and the steam aura and burst attacks don't occur.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>To disable a Pillar, 1 success is required on either a @Check[type:crafting|dc:26|name:Disable Pillar|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained), @Check[type:arcana|dc:26|name:Disable Pillar 2|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained), or @Check[type:thievery|dc:26|name:Disable Pillar 2|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained) check.</p>"
        },
